---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';

const title = "Hakkımızda - Antalya Karotcu";
const description = "1995 yılında kurulan Antalya Karotcu, Türkiye genelinde endüstriyel beton kesme ve yapısal güçlendirme standartlarını belirlemektedir.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
    <section class="relative h-[70vh] w-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-strong flex items-center">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-bg via-bg/80 to-transparent z-10"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590059530490-674391c49a04?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-50 mix-blend-overlay" data-alt="Massive concrete bridge structure under construction dark moody"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 z-10 industrial-grid"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-20 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="max-w-4xl">
                <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-l-4 border-primary pl-4">
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Kuruluş 1995</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="mb-8 text-6xl font-black uppercase leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter text-text sm:text-7xl md:text-9xl">
                    Temelimiz<br/>
                    <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-orange-500">Hassasiyet</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="max-w-xl text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-xl border-t border-border pt-6">
                    Yaklaşık otuz yıldır, bölgedeki endüstriyel beton kesme ve yapısal güçlendirme standartlarını belirliyoruz.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-2 w-full bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#ff6600,#ff6600_20px,#1a1a1a_20px,#1a1a1a_40px)] opacity-80"></div>
    </section>

    <div class="border-y border-border bg-surface relative z-30">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:grid-cols-4">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                    <span class="text-6xl font-black text-text tracking-tighter">28<span class="text-primary text-4xl align-top">+</span></span>
                    <span class="h-1 w-12 bg-primary"></span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-muted mt-2">Yıllık Mükemmellik</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                    <span class="text-6xl font-black text-text tracking-tighter">5k<span class="text-primary text-4xl align-top">+</span></span>
                    <span class="h-1 w-12 bg-primary"></span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-muted mt-2">Teslim Edilen Proje</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                    <span class="text-6xl font-black text-text tracking-tighter">100<span class="text-primary text-4xl align-top">%</span></span>
                    <span class="h-1 w-12 bg-primary"></span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-muted mt-2">Güvenlik Rekoru</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                    <span class="text-6xl font-black text-text tracking-tighter">81</span>
                    <span class="h-1 w-12 bg-primary"></span>
                    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-muted mt-2">Hizmet Verilen Şehir</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-bg py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16">
                <div class="md:w-1/3 sticky top-24 self-start">
                    <h2 class="text-primary text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">Tarihçemiz</h2>
                    <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-text mb-6 leading-none">Bir Miras<br/>İnşa Ediyoruz</h3>
                    <p class="text-text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
                        Antalya'da tek bir karot ünitesinden, ağır endüstriyel makinelerden oluşan ülke çapında bir filoya. Yolculuğumuz sağlam çözümlerle döşeli.
                    </p>
                    <div class="h-64 w-full rounded overflow-hidden relative border-2 border-white/5">
                        <img alt="Vintage construction site black and white" class="object-cover w-full h-full opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDLjV4hHt_vht3tpYfeSp9KUSc7zcw6rvlx05puMiin_AyHQ5ka5_96dir8es5sIipsukUP6d1mZEgAgzAd5jaSUMqt73tcHIAxKo-5zeJgHMPcHHFXCP9U0SCCBjA-GEq9HeO8bKuqInzUg2iPoQ5kubFzW_PCIMNCqNPh8iK5ppNirgXyQDlxnKeDxC_vilIDDa2hQ4Glabo56pegmwTTmxQ400ch2gysbolfKUAE9DDhzBp8EELW83qHvbPmKSbRHDhgbVsyu7k3"/>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/20 mix-blend-overlay"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="md:w-2/3 relative pl-8 md:pl-16 border-l border-border space-y-20">
                    <div class="relative group">
                        <div class="absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-[73px] top-2 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-surface-strong border-4 border-primary shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,102,0,0.5)] group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></div>
                        <span class="text-7xl font-black text-white/5 absolute -top-12 -left-4 select-none z-0">1995</span>
                        <div class="relative z-10">
                            <span class="text-primary font-bold text-lg mb-2 block">Başlangıç</span>
                            <h4 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text uppercase mb-4">Antalya'da Kuruldu</h4>
                            <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                                Antalya Karotcu, bölgenin patlama yapan turizm inşaat sektöründeki hassas beton modifikasyonu talebini karşılamak için kuruldu. Sadece iki operatörle başlayarak, temizlik ve doğruluk konusunda yeni bir standart belirledik.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative group">
                        <div class="absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-[73px] top-2 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-surface-strong border-4 border-gray-600 group-hover:border-primary transition-colors"></div>
                        <span class="text-7xl font-black text-white/5 absolute -top-12 -left-4 select-none z-0">2008</span>
                        <div class="relative z-10">
                            <span class="text-primary font-bold text-lg mb-2 block">Genişleme</span>
                            <h4 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text uppercase mb-4">Ağır Makine Filosu</h4>
                            <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                                İlk uzaktan kumandalı yıkım robotlarımızı ve ağır hizmet tipi tel kesme makinelerimizi edinerek, Akdeniz bölgesindeki köprüler ve barajlar dahil olmak üzere devasa altyapı projelerini üstlendik.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative group">
                        <div class="absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-[73px] top-2 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-surface-strong border-4 border-gray-600 group-hover:border-primary transition-colors"></div>
                        <span class="text-7xl font-black text-white/5 absolute -top-12 -left-4 select-none z-0">2015</span>
                        <div class="relative z-10">
                            <span class="text-primary font-bold text-lg mb-2 block">İnovasyon</span>
                            <h4 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text uppercase mb-4">Teknik Sertifikasyon</h4>
                            <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                                ISO 9001:2015 sertifikası alındı ve sektör lideri güvenlik protokolleri uygulandı. Ekibimiz, karmaşık kimyasal ankraj ve sismik güçlendirme projelerini yürüten 50'den fazla sertifikalı uzmana ulaştı.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative group">
                        <div class="absolute -left-[41px] md:-left-[73px] top-2 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-surface-strong border-4 border-gray-600 group-hover:border-primary transition-colors"></div>
                        <span class="text-7xl font-black text-white/5 absolute -top-12 -left-4 select-none z-0">2023</span>
                        <div class="relative z-10">
                            <span class="text-primary font-bold text-lg mb-2 block">Bugün</span>
                            <h4 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text uppercase mb-4">Ulusal Liderlik</h4>
                            <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                                5.000'den fazla başarılı proje ile artık Türkiye'nin en büyük inşaat firmalarının tercih ettiği çözüm ortağıyız. Filomuz, Avrupa'dan gelen son teknoloji elmas kesim teknolojisi ile tamamen modernize edilmiştir.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-surface-strong py-24 border-t border-white/5 relative">
        <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-1/2 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621905251189-08b45d6a269e?q=80&w=2069&auto=format&fit=crop')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-5 mix-blend-luminosity"></div>
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <h2 class="text-primary text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">Temelimiz</h2>
                <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-text mb-6">Temel Değerler</h3>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-lg">
                    Sadece beton kesmiyoruz; güven inşa ediyoruz. Bu üç sütun, üstlendiğimiz her operasyonu desteklemektedir.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="bg-bg border border-border p-10 hover:border-primary transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-9xl text-text">health_and_safety</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center h-16 w-16 rounded bg-surface-strong border border-primary text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,102,0,0.2)]">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-4xl">health_and_safety</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text uppercase mb-4">Önce Güvenlik</h4>
                    <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                        Hata payı olmayan yüksek riskli ortamlarda çalışıyoruz. Sıfır kaza kültürümüz, sıkı eğitimler, üstün KKD ve katı saha protokolleri ile desteklenmektedir.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-bg border border-border p-10 hover:border-primary transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-9xl text-text">precision_manufacturing</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center h-16 w-16 rounded bg-surface-strong border border-primary text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,102,0,0.2)]">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-4xl">precision_manufacturing</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text uppercase mb-4">Teknik Doğruluk</h4>
                    <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                        Yapısal bütünlük milimetrik hassasiyet gerektirir. Her kesimin projelere tam olarak uymasını sağlamak için gelişmiş elmas kesim teknolojisi ve lazer rehberliği kullanıyoruz.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-bg border border-border p-10 hover:border-primary transition-colors group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-9xl text-text">local_shipping</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center h-16 w-16 rounded bg-surface-strong border border-primary text-primary shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,102,0,0.2)]">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined !text-4xl">verified_user</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text uppercase mb-4">Ulusal Güvenilirlik</h4>
                    <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                        İnşaatta vakit nakittir. Proje ister Antalya'da ister ülkenin diğer ucunda olsun, hızlı mobilizasyon ve sıkı teslim tarihlerine uyma konusunda kendimizle gurur duyuyoruz.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-bg py-20 border-t border-white/5">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12">
            <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                <img alt="Team operating wall saw" class="rounded border-2 border-border grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500 w-full shadow-2xl" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBHiYKTo_1TTRS_Dln22dgXJbLPaXu6-cHM10xmBhwFipDp-2vi5jo5bsZAXwvdDQUyqXzLqGXqj-E-VtUGIVJvNqNliOBihGmKSbxk_EHgven-UlQkp4-qWDXr99_VioYr7nCbZNAKoF0zac0TTWL-s8fQUiAoLKr9HPltFex5iFl5g_IjRpn2jmpjYhhdraTfm6zP_TpXmq14WA7fGRWPEADl79Ka9LsaKGfeaTgQMuKetqpynFAFZaZTi1Dd2EG1SE6XhO000_A"/>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase text-text mb-6">Usta Zanaatkarlar</h3>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-lg mb-8">
                    Operatörlerimiz sadece işçi değildir; sertifikalı teknisyenlerdir. Her ekip üyesi, bir şantiyeye adım atmadan önce 200 saatten fazla özel ekipman eğitimi alır.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-surface-strong px-4 py-2 rounded border border-border text-text-muted text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">İSG Sertifikalı</div>
                    <div class="bg-surface-strong px-4 py-2 rounded border border-border text-text-muted text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Hilti Eğitimli</div>
                    <div class="bg-surface-strong px-4 py-2 rounded border border-border text-text-muted text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">İlk Yardım Sertifikalı</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-primary py-16 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PHBhdGggZD0iTTEgMWgydjJIMUMxeiIgZmlsbD0iIzAwMCIgZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5PSIwLjEiLz48L3N2Zz4=')] opacity-20"></div>
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black uppercase text-white mb-2">Uzmanlarla Çalışın</h2>
                <p class="text-white/80 text-lg font-medium">Yapısal gereksinimlerinizi mühendislerimizle bugün görüşün.</p>
            </div>
             <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full md:w-auto">
                 <Button variant="outline" class="px-8 py-4" href="#">
                     Teklif İste
                 </Button>
             </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
